            <title><![CDATA[Senate faces long to-do list and little time before recess]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/senate-faces-long-to-do-list-and-little-time-before-recess</link>
            <description><![CDATA[The Senate is just days away from taking its month-long August recess, but Congress is also rapidly running out of time to avoid a government shutdown this fall and handle a host of other items. Lawmakers are scrambling to take action on everything from funding the Iran war to regulating cryptocurrency. Lisa Desjardins reports on the developments on Capitol Hill.]]></description>
