            <title><![CDATA[Paid early access to Trump's posts raises insider trading questions]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/paid-early-access-to-trumps-posts-raises-insider-trading-questions</link>
            <description><![CDATA[President Trump is selling early access to his social media posts. Truth Social launched a subscription service giving a first look at posts from the president. The price tag is reportedly up to $100,000 a month. Critics are raising alarms over paying customers seeing market-moving statements from a sitting president before the public. Geoff Bennett discussed more with Bobby Allyn of NPR.]]></description>
